WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360
A kidney transplant goes well.

2
00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:06.480
Then, some weeks later, the
new kidney starts to fail.

3
00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:11.040
And a mother's immune system can turn
against the red blood cells of her own unborn

4
00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.120
baby.

5
00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:14.710
If the body attacks only what is foreign,

6
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:18.330
why would it turn on a
new kidney, or on a baby?

7
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:22.170
In this mission, you'll follow one
mother through two pregnancies,

8
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:26.420
and see why the second baby can
be at risk when the first was not.

9
00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:29.960
Then you'll see how doctors can
dial the immune system down,

10
00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:32.300
and the price a patient pays.

11
00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:37.130
Your mission: explain why a body that
attacks only what is foreign can turn on

12
00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.470
a new kidney or an unborn baby.
